Package: usedns
Version: DEB_VERSION
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: UseDNS <usedns@x-labs.my.id>
Homepage: https://github.com/x-labs-myid/UseDNS
Depends: libc6, libfontconfig1, libfreetype6, libxkbcommon0, libxcb1, libxcb-shape0, libxcb-xfixes0, libxcb-render0
Description: Desktop utility for choosing and applying DNS resolvers
 UseDNS is a lightweight desktop app for comparing public DNS
 providers and applying them from a simple interface.
 Changing system DNS is currently supported on Windows only;
 the Linux build runs the UI.
